sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Worker/Engineer
  participant T as submit_candidate Tool
  participant I as Completion Interlock
  participant V as Verifier Registry
  participant O as Oversight
  participant L as Mission Ledger
  W->>T: Candidate + evidence mapping
  T->>L: candidate/submitted
  T-->>W: receipt; conclude turn
  T->>I: verify proposal
  I->>I: identity/version/tool/artifact/scope checks
  I->>V: execute acceptance contract
  V-->>I: verifier receipts
  I->>O: anomaly inspection when required
  O-->>I: read-only inspection report
  alt accepted
    I->>L: task/accepted (CAS)
  else rework
    I->>L: task/rework-requested
  else freeze
    I->>L: oversight/frozen
  end
